==Trivia==
* A similar advantage called the Vote Stopper appeared on {{S|2016au}}, a year before its introduction to the American version of the show.
* Coincidentally, the person playing the Vote Blocker and the target have always been of opposite genders.
* [[Savannah Louie]] is the first person to be voted out with a Vote Blocker in her possession. She is also the only player to possess a Vote Blocker and never use it.

